{
  "la": {
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_NAME": "Desolator",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "Desolator est fons ambulans radiationis et damni in area.<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > Tormentum Rad tres cumulos Radiationis imponit, alias artes adiuvans ut plus damni inferant.\n\n< ! > Terra Adusta grave damnum infert et multos quoque cumulos radiationis accumulat.\n\n< ! > Velocitate motus Reactoris utere ut ex angustia evadas, aut proprietate eius debilitante utere ad damnum additum inferendum.\n\n< ! > Perniciem Spargere te impetibus exponit, sed diutius explicatum manere praemio est ad damnum et radiationem augenda.\n\n< ! > Clavis maximi damni inferendi est Radiationem in hostibus cumulare ut damnum artium tuarum augeas.\n\n</color>",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SUBTITLE": "Ecce Venit Sol",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_LORE": "<i>Una cum [OCCULTATO], Ministerium Informationis exhibet...</i>\n<i>DESOLATOR: HEROS REVOLUTIONARIUS CONTRA TYRANNIDEM!</i>\n\nPellicula crepitat, aetatem suam velut rubiginem in metallo ostendens, attamen in taenia volvitur. Agitur in receptaculo ruinoso cuius ianua armata ferro ferruminata est et ad margines omnibus rebus in conclavi munita: libris, sellis, lecto. Solus sedet vir trepidus, spectans.\n\n<i>DESOLATOR, olim pauper puer innocens ex vicis miserrimis qui nihil nisi ODIUM a regimine tyrannico accepit! Viam quaesivit ut se et sodales suos a barbaris liberaret!\nIpse GLORIOSAM NOSTRAM REVOLUTIONEM ordinavit! Iuxta viros in prima acie pugnans ne ullum proelium amitteretur!\nSed tandem GRAVITER VULNERATUS est et, vi technologiae experimentalis ab OPPRESSORIBUS nostris subreptae utens, in heroem quem hodie novimus REFECTUS est!</i>\n\nReceptaculum tremit, dum unica eius lucerna huc et illuc oscillat. Praeteritum eius eum assecutum erat, cuius opus eum persequi veniebat.\nNemo veritatem factorum eius scit; munus enim eius erat ea occultare. Sed tale munus tantam mentis firmitatem poscebat ut res gestas fucatas sustineret.\nClamores extra receptaculum audiri poterant, mox in sonum quasi limi submersi.\n\n<i>DESOLATOR ad frontem proelii rediit! Omnes cives suos servans-</i>\n'Trucidati sunt.'\n<i>ne idem onus ac ipse ferrent!-</i>\n'Fratribus nostris armorum tantum doloris intulisti quantum hosti.'\n<i>DESOLATOR ET REVOLUTIO SODALIUM EIUS PLANETAM NOSTRUM SERVAVERUNT, IN QUO SOCIETATEM QUAM HODIE HABEMUS AEDIFICAVIT!</i>\n'Nihil reliquisti nisi flumen rubrum cadaverum pro causa cui non credebas; servator revolutionis excusationem perfectam habebat.'\n\nSed priusquam taeniam spectare pergeret, vir anxius cutem horrescere et sudorem manare sensit. Ille aderat.\nAntequam alia cogitatio formari posset, ianua viridi colore iridiscente fulget ac liquescere incipit. Pessuli qui ianuam clausam tenebant, qui cineri nucleari resistere poterant, sicut butyrum ad cultrum calidum liquefacti sunt. Reliquiae munitionis per pavimentum liquescebant, massae metalli et supellectilis ardentes, in ius radioactivum conflatae. Est ille, est-\n\n<i>DESOLATOR!</i>\n\nPellicula sollemniter sonat, priusquam reliquias taeniae balbutiat, tandem sicut ianua ante eam dissolvens.\nAntequam verba commutari possent, caro liquescens viri morientis scindi et e corpore labi coepit, similis carni lente coctae. Oculi eius caligaverunt, ultimum aspectum in praesentiam radioactivam figentes dum illa ultima verba quae vir umquam auditurus erat loquebatur.\n\n'St, finis prope est.'\n\nCerebrum fluitans, musculi stillantes ut sceletum subiacentem nudarent, dum etiam structura atomica ossium liquescere coepit. Mox ipsum cubiculum instabile fiebat; ultima quae discesserunt fuerunt graves passus caligarum ferrearum et anhelitus gravis. Respiratio eius sola res humana in eo erat.",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..atque ita discessit, post se relinquens oasim mortis.",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..atque ita evanuit, finis prope erat.",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_MASTERY_SKIN_NAME": "Profanatio",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_PASSIVE_NAME": "Radiatio",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "Impetus Desolatoris plus damni inferunt scopis <style=cIsHealing>Irradiatis</style>: <style=cIsDamage>+0.04x</style> per cumulum <style=cIsHealing>Radiationis</style>.",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_PRIMARY_BEAM_NAME": "Tormentum Rad",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_PRIMARY_BEAM_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>Irradians</style>. Pete hostem radio radiationis pro <style=cIsDamage>80% damni</style> et 3 cumulis <style=cIsHealing>Radiationis</style>.",
    "KEYWORD_RADIATION_PRIMARY": "<style=cKeywordName>Irradians</style><style=cSub>Imponit 3 cumulos <style=cIsHealing>Radiationis</style>, inferens <style=cIsDamage>201% damni</style> per <style=cIsUtility>8 secundas</style>.</style>",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SECONDARY_BIGBEAM_NAME": "Terra Adusta",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SECONDARY_BIGBEAM_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>Irradians</style>. Explode aream pro <style=cIsDamage>320% damni</style> et aream radiatione tege per <style=cIsUtility>2 secundas</style>. Hostes in contactu accipiunt <style=cIsDamage>20% damni bis in secunda</style>",
    "KEYWORD_RADIATION_SECONDARY": "<style=cKeywordName>Irradians</style><style=cSub><style=cIsHealth>Explosio Initialis</style>: Infert <style=cIsDamage>112% damni</style> per <style=cIsUtility>8 secundas</style>.\n<style=cIsHealth>Area Manens</style>: Quisque pulsus infert <style=cIsDamage>56% damni</style> per <style=cIsUtility>8 secundas</style>.</style>",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_UTILITY_AURA_NAME": "Reactor",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_UTILITY_AURA_DESCRIPTION": "Per <style=cIsUtility>4 secundas</style>, <style=cIsDamage>Debilita</style> omnes hostes propinquos, et accipe augmentum <style=cIsUtility>velocitatis motus</style> atque <style=cIsUtility>armaturae</style>",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_DEPLOY_NAME": "Perniciem Spargere",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_DEPLOY_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>Irradians</style>. Figas Tormentum Rad tuum in terram. Accipe <style=cIsUtility>munimentum</style> pro quoque hoste propinquo. <style=cIsUtility>Singulis 3 secundis</style>, effunde stagnum radiationis quod durat <style=cIsUtility>7 secundas</style>, inferens <style=cIsDamage>20% damni per secundam</style>.",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPTER_DEPLOY_NAME": "Vale Vicinia",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPTER_DEPLOY_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>Irradians</style>. Figas Tormentum Rad tuum in terram. Accipe <style=cIsUtility>munimentum</style> pro quoque hoste propinquo. <style=cIsUtility>Singulis 3 secundis</style>, effunde stagnum radiationis quod durat <style=cIsUtility>7 secundas</style>, inferens <style=cIsDamage>20% damni per secundam</style>.\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTRUM: Area duplicata. Pulsus per secundam 1.5x celeriores.</color>",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_DEPLOY_CANCEL_NAME": "Abroga",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_DEPLOY_CANCEL_DESCRIPTION": "Desine Perniciem Spargere",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_IRRADIATOR_NAME": "Irradiatores",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_IRRADIATOR_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>Irradians</style>. Iace <style=cIsUtility>usque ad 2</style> Irradiatores qui magnam aream radiatione tegunt per <style=cIsUtility>11 secundas</style>, inferentes <style=cIsDamage>15% damni per secundam</style>.",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPTER_IRRADIATOR_NAME": "Irradiatores Instabiles",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPTER_IRRADIATOR_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>Irradians</style>. Iace <style=cIsUtility>usque ad 2</style> Irradiatores qui magnam aream radiatione tegunt per <style=cIsUtility>11 secundas</style>, inferentes <style=cIsDamage>15% damni per secundam</style>.\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTRUM: Explodit fine temporis pro <style=cIsDamage>1600% damni</style>.</color>",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_IRRADIATOR_NAME_FUN": "Virgae Lucentes",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_IRRADIATOR_DESCRIPTION_FUN": "<style=cIsHealing>Irradians</style>. Iace <style=cIsUtility>usque ad 2</style> Virgas Lucentes quae magnam aream radiatione tegunt per <style=cIsUtility>11 secundas</style>, inferentes <style=cIsDamage>15% damni per secundam</style>.",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPTER_IRRADIATOR_NAME_FUN": "Virgae Lucentes Instabiles",
    "HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPTER_IRRADIATOR_DESCRIPTION_FUN": "<style=cIsHealing>Irradians</style>. Iace <style=cIsUtility>usque ad 2</style> Virgas Lucentes quae magnam aream radiatione tegunt per <style=cIsUtility>11 secundas</style>, inferentes <style=cIsDamage>15% damni per secundam</style>.\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTRUM: Explodit fine temporis pro <style=cIsDamage>1600% damni</style>.</color>",
    "KEYWORD_RADIATION_SPECIAL": "<style=cKeywordName>Irradians</style><style=cSub>Quisque pulsus infert <style=cIsDamage>78% damni</style> per <style=cIsUtility>8 secundas</style>.</style>",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_NAME": "Desolator: Magisterium",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_DESCRIPTION": "Ut Desolator, ludum vince vel in Monsoon te oblitera.",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_GRANDMASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_NAME": "Desolator: Summum Magisterium",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_HABIBI_DESOLATOR_BODY_GRANDMASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_DESCRIPTION": "Ut Desolator, ludum vince vel in Typhoon aut Eclipse te oblitera.\n<color=#8888>(Numerat quamlibet difficultatem Typhoon vel superiorem)</color>",
